flowchart TB
  A[Start]
  A --> B[Fetch data]
  B --> C[Transform]
  C --> D[Publish]

timeline:
  enter B fade, enter A-B fade
  enter C fade, enter B-C fade
  enter D fade, enter C-D fade
  highlight B outline
  highlight D glow, unhighlight B
